# Phase 156.2c: SKY RUN in the app refuses, and says why.
#
# The emulator's rig.ini has none of the sky run's limits or a park, so
# START in the app's own window refuses with every reason, and nothing
# moves (the owner's rule, 2026-11-21: the app is the instrument, Dash a
# remote; this is the app's control, not Dash's).

name    Sky run: refused from the app's window, with every reason
timeout 120

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Sky run
wait   3
press  SKYRUN:SHOW
press  SKYRUN:START
expect 10  [SKYRUN] refused:
shot   refused
